{
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 26, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Deep research · Benchmark</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>13 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 26 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>深度研究 · 评测基准</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 13 分钟</span>",
 "Two research reports can satisfy the same number of rubrics and still be very different reports: one wide and shallow, the other narrow and deep. DRBench Pro keeps the structure of the knowledge when it scores a report, so breadth and depth can be measured separately.": "两份研究报告可以满足同样数量的评分细则，内容却大不相同：一份面面俱到而浅尝辄止，另一份只聚焦少数方向却深入到底。DRBench Pro 在评分时保留知识的结构，从而分别衡量广度与深度。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University <sup>2</sup>Tencent · *Equal contribution †Corresponding author": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 <sup>2</sup>腾讯 · *共同第一作者 †通讯作者",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.34852\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/DRBenchPro\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/zhuiluozhiji/DRBenchPro\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3\"></path></svg>Dataset</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/DRBenchPro/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>Project page</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.34852\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/DRBenchPro\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/zhuiluozhiji/DRBenchPro\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3\"></path></svg>数据集</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/DRBenchPro/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>项目主页</a>",
